M.I.B. - More Incredible Bash V3.7.3 "long time ago..."

NOTE: NEVER interrupt the process with -Back- button or removing SD Card!!!
CAUTION: Ensure that a external power is connected to the car on during any
flash or programming process! Power failure during flasing/programming will
brick your unit! - All you do and use at your own risk!


